{"video":"dd-P5Y_7Mfg","lines":[{"t":[0,6.9],"en":"Oh..."},{"t":[6.9,24.2],"en":"I saw a friend today, it had been a while"},{"t":[25.8,28.6],"en":"We forgot each other's names"},{"t":[28.6,34.2],"en":"But it didn't matter cause deep inside"},{"t":[34.2,38],"en":"The feelings still remain the same"},{"t":[38,43.2],"en":"Imagine going back and watching a tape of your life"},{"t":[43.2,47.6],"en":"You could see yourself change"},{"t":[47.6,50],"en":"And make mistakes"},{"t":[50,52.2],"en":"And grow up"},{"t":[52.2,55.8],"en":"You could watch yourself fall in love"},{"t":[57.3,59.5],"en":"Watch yourself become a husband"},{"t":[59.5,61.6],"en":"Become a father"},{"t":[61.6,65.7],"en":"You guys gave that to me"},{"t":[65.7,70.8],"en":"And that's an amazing gift"},{"t":[70.8,74.8],"en":"Hey Jim, remember Flankerton when you did Office Olympics?"},{"t":[74.8,76.8],"en":"It was awesome"},{"t":[76.8,78.2],"en":"Thanks, Phil"},{"t":[78.2,80.1],"en":"I still have my medal from that"},{"t":[80.1,81.7],"en":"Do you even have a mattress?"},{"t":[82.1,83.7],"en":"No, but I still have my medal from that"},{"t":[83.7,90.3],"en":"Oscar"},{"t":[90.3,92.4],"en":"Oscar"},{"t":[92.4,95.9],"en":"I think I'm gay"},{"t":[95.9,99.1],"en":"Why do you say that?"},{"t":[100.5,102.6],"en":"It's just that I'm so emotional"},{"t":[102.6,103.5],"en":"You're not gay"},{"t":[103.5,104.6],"en":"You're not gay"},{"t":[104.6,106.7],"en":"No, but maybe the reason"},{"t":[106.7,107.3],"en":"You're not gay"},{"t":[107.3,111.3],"en":"And all the faces that I know"},{"t":[111.3,115.9],"en":"Have that same familiar glow"},{"t":[115.9,121.5],"en":"I think I must have known them somewhere once before"},{"t":[121.5,123],"en":"How did you do it?"},{"t":[123.3,125.4],"en":"How did you capture what it was really like?"},{"t":[125.9,127],"en":"How we felt"},{"t":[127,128.9],"en":"And how we made each other laugh"},{"t":[128.9,130.8],"en":"And how we got through the day"},{"t":[130.8,132.4],"en":"How did you do it?"},{"t":[133.4,135],"en":"Also, how do cameras work?"},{"t":[135.7,136.9],"en":"Every day when I came into work"},{"t":[136.9,138.2],"en":"All I wanted to do was leave"},{"t":[138.2,140.2],"en":"So why in the world"},{"t":[140.2,142.2],"en":"Does it feel so hard to leave right now?"},{"t":[143.3,145.5],"en":"It all seems so very arbitrary"},{"t":[145.5,148.9],"en":"I applied for a job at this company"},{"t":[148.9,150],"en":"Because they were hiring"},{"t":[150,152.6],"en":"I took a desk at the back"},{"t":[152.6,153.9],"en":"Because it was empty"},{"t":[153.9,154.9],"en":"But"},{"t":[154.9,157.7],"en":"No matter how you get there"},{"t":[157.7,159.1],"en":"Or where you end up"},{"t":[159.1,161.1],"en":"Human beings have this"},{"t":[161.1,162.5],"en":"Miraculous gift"},{"t":[162.5,164.5],"en":"To make that place home"},{"t":[164.5,174.4],"en":"Let's do this"},{"t":[174.4,178.5],"en":"I just feel lucky"},{"t":[178.5,179.5],"en":"That I got a chance"},{"t":[179.5,181.1],"en":"To share my crummy story"},{"t":[181.1,182.5],"en":"With anyone out there"},{"t":[182.5,184.1],"en":"Who thinks of the only one"},{"t":[184.1,185],"en":"To take a dump"},{"t":[185,185.9],"en":"In a paper shredder"},{"t":[185.9,187.7],"en":"You're not alone, sister"},{"t":[187.7,189.9],"en":"Let's get a beer sometime"},{"t":[189.9,198.3],"en":"I'm happy that this was all filmed"},{"t":[198.3,200.1],"en":"So I can remember everyone"},{"t":[200.1,201.3],"en":"And what we did"},{"t":[201.3,204.4],"en":"I worked for a paper company"},{"t":[204.4,205.1],"en":"All these years"},{"t":[205.1,207.1],"en":"And I never wrote anything down"},{"t":[207.1,214.5],"en":"I sold paper at this company"},{"t":[214.5,215.4],"en":"For 12 years"},{"t":[215.4,217.2],"en":"My job was to speak to clients"},{"t":[217.2,218],"en":"On the phone"},{"t":[218,219.1],"en":"About quantities"},{"t":[219.1,221.4],"en":"And types of copier paper"},{"t":[221.4,222.9],"en":"Even if I didn't love"},{"t":[222.9,223.8],"en":"Every minute of it"},{"t":[223.8,227.2],"en":"Everything I have"},{"t":[227.2,229.2],"en":"I owe to this job"},{"t":[229.2,229.29999999999998],"en":"I owe to this job"},{"t":[229.29999999999998,232.5],"en":"This stupid"},{"t":[232.5,234.1],"en":"Wonderful"},{"t":[234.1,236.4],"en":"Boring"},{"t":[236.4,239.3],"en":"Amazing job"},{"t":[239.3,242.8],"en":"I thought it was weird"},{"t":[242.8,244.7],"en":"When you picked us"},{"t":[244.7,245.7],"en":"To make a documentary"},{"t":[245.7,248.7],"en":"But all in all"},{"t":[248.7,252.1],"en":"I think an ordinary paper company"},{"t":[252.1,253.3],"en":"Like Dunder Mifflin"},{"t":[253.3,254.2],"en":"Was a great subject"},{"t":[254.2,255.1],"en":"For a documentary"},{"t":[255.1,258.3],"en":"There's a lot of beauty"},{"t":[258.3,259.8],"en":"In ordinary things"},{"t":[259.8,262.5],"en":"Isn't that kind of the point"},{"t":[277.6,278.6],"en":"Is that kind of the point?"},{"t":[290.6,291.3],"en":"Thank you."}]}
